1
00:00:16,534 --> 00:00:22,869
(Firefly Theater)

2
00:00:43,456 --> 00:00:47,392
♪Neon lights twist into a knot♪

3
00:00:49,024 --> 00:00:52,608
♪I rest in the ruins of defeat♪

4
00:00:53,184 --> 00:00:55,520
♪You tap your fingers lightly♪

5
00:00:55,904 --> 00:00:58,656
♪I fall into the abyss♪

6
00:00:59,488 --> 00:01:02,080
♪I've seen this game before♪

7
00:01:02,080 --> 00:01:04,768
♪Every single move was calculated♪

8
00:01:04,768 --> 00:01:07,168
♪I finally see your silhouette♪

9
00:01:07,552 --> 00:01:10,304
♪Just an empty shell♪

10
00:01:10,624 --> 00:01:13,440
♪I've broken this game before♪

11
00:01:13,440 --> 00:01:15,872
♪Every move was placed wrong♪

12
00:01:15,872 --> 00:01:18,016
♪Now it's my turn to play♪

13
00:01:18,208 --> 00:01:25,056
♪I'll show you what stunning looks like♪

14
00:01:25,728 --> 00:01:28,256
♪When I stand back up again♪

15
00:01:28,544 --> 00:01:30,400
♪The whole city goes dark♪

16
00:01:31,264 --> 00:01:33,952
♪For the part you owe me♪

17
00:01:34,112 --> 00:01:41,088
♪I'll make you pay double♪

18
00:01:42,624 --> 00:01:47,360
♪You're just my starting point♪

19
00:01:51,712 --> 00:01:52,739
=The Vanishing Beauty=

20
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:55,720
=Episode 14=

21
00:02:08,739 --> 00:02:09,580
Ms. Hui?

22
00:02:14,820 --> 00:02:15,580
Ms. Hui,

23
00:02:15,860 --> 00:02:16,700
take it easy.

24
00:02:16,899 --> 00:02:18,100
My car didn't come cheap.

25
00:02:19,059 --> 00:02:19,820
I can afford it.

26
00:02:22,059 --> 00:02:23,140
Why are you here?

27
00:02:23,540 --> 00:02:24,339
Just passing by.

28
00:02:24,459 --> 00:02:25,140
Passing by?

29
00:02:27,020 --> 00:02:28,499
That was quite a close call.

30
00:02:28,700 --> 00:02:29,619
But seriously,

31
00:02:29,779 --> 00:02:30,779
drive safe from now on.

32
00:02:31,700 --> 00:02:32,580
The car

33
00:02:32,580 --> 00:02:33,459
we got you

34
00:02:33,499 --> 00:02:34,380
has decent specs,

35
00:02:34,779 --> 00:02:35,779
but it's nowhere

36
00:02:36,339 --> 00:02:37,580
near mine.

37
00:02:37,980 --> 00:02:39,540
If there's an actual crash,

38
00:02:40,260 --> 00:02:41,864
who do you think will survive?

39
00:02:46,380 --> 00:02:47,459
The brakes suddenly failed.

40
00:02:48,700 --> 00:02:49,939
I'll drop it off at the dealer.

41
00:03:14,700 --> 00:03:15,339
How are you?

42
00:03:15,700 --> 00:03:16,899
Let's get you checked out.

43
00:03:17,540 --> 00:03:18,659
Don't worry. I'm fine.

44
00:03:18,899 --> 00:03:19,624
We didn't crash.

45
00:03:23,540 --> 00:03:24,659
Lu Hui is usually so calm,

46
00:03:24,739 --> 00:03:25,300
yet she acted

47
00:03:25,300 --> 00:03:26,260
so rashly for Harry.

48
00:03:26,860 --> 00:03:27,580
Exactly.

49
00:03:28,179 --> 00:03:30,420
Harry must be her weak spot.

50
00:03:32,140 --> 00:03:33,020
I'm heading back.

51
00:03:33,339 --> 00:03:34,140
I need to sort out

52
00:03:34,179 --> 00:03:35,059
the forum thing fast.

53
00:03:36,059 --> 00:03:36,540
Watch out!

54
00:03:55,059 --> 00:03:56,420
What's wrong with you?

55
00:03:57,020 --> 00:03:58,700
Starving, or did you overeat?

56
00:03:59,420 --> 00:04:00,059
It's nothing.

57
00:04:00,939 --> 00:04:03,059
I hiccup when I get nervous.

58
00:04:04,580 --> 00:04:05,779
Hiccups when nervous?

59
00:04:07,059 --> 00:04:07,619
It's nothing.

60
00:04:08,300 --> 00:04:09,260
Really, it's nothing.

61
00:04:09,380 --> 00:04:10,179
Go on upstairs

62
00:04:10,260 --> 00:04:11,339
and get some warm water.

63
00:04:11,499 --> 00:04:12,499
I'll head back now.

64
00:04:25,820 --> 00:04:27,140
Mom, you're back.

65
00:04:35,700 --> 00:04:36,620
You made all this?

66
00:04:36,899 --> 00:04:37,820
Studying abroad

67
00:04:37,940 --> 00:04:39,580
turns every student into a chef.

68
00:04:39,979 --> 00:04:41,339
I even practiced beforehand

69
00:04:41,380 --> 00:04:42,060
and made Dad

70
00:04:42,099 --> 00:04:43,060
pork and egg congee.

71
00:04:43,060 --> 00:04:43,912
Let me get you some.

72
00:04:45,099 --> 00:04:46,339
Don't think

73
00:04:46,339 --> 00:04:47,979
this excuses what you did.

74
00:04:49,099 --> 00:04:50,459
Getting into fights now?

75
00:04:51,500 --> 00:04:52,580
And over a woman?

76
00:04:53,219 --> 00:04:54,099
You know that too?

77
00:04:54,380 --> 00:04:55,459
What do you know about her

78
00:04:55,620 --> 00:04:56,459
or her family?

79
00:04:56,899 --> 00:04:58,248
And you stepped up for her?

80
00:04:59,140 --> 00:05:00,339
Why should I care?

81
00:05:00,539 --> 00:05:02,659
All I know is she's a good person.

82
00:05:02,859 --> 00:05:03,459
That's enough.

83
00:05:03,740 --> 00:05:04,899
So you know nothing

84
00:05:05,459 --> 00:05:06,459
about her background?

85
00:05:07,419 --> 00:05:08,339
Not entirely.

86
00:05:08,539 --> 00:05:09,700
I know her name

87
00:05:10,180 --> 00:05:11,060
and her address.

88
00:05:11,140 --> 00:05:12,260
Have you met her husband?

89
00:05:12,419 --> 00:05:12,940
No.

90
00:05:13,099 --> 00:05:13,979
I hit it off with her,

91
00:05:13,979 --> 00:05:14,940
not her husband.

92
00:05:15,299 --> 00:05:16,380
Why ask so many questions?

93
00:05:16,419 --> 00:05:17,459
Hit it off?

94
00:05:18,260 --> 00:05:19,500
You said she's married.

95
00:05:19,700 --> 00:05:20,820
Her husband can handle it.

96
00:05:21,339 --> 00:05:22,180
Why should you care?

97
00:05:22,419 --> 00:05:23,380
Her husband is useless.

98
00:05:23,459 --> 00:05:24,659
So I helped out. What's wrong?

99
00:05:24,779 --> 00:05:25,459
Helped out?

100
00:05:26,459 --> 00:05:27,099
So many

101
00:05:27,180 --> 00:05:28,020
pretty young girls

102
00:05:28,099 --> 00:05:28,659
out there,

103
00:05:28,859 --> 00:05:29,419
and you're

104
00:05:29,419 --> 00:05:30,580
chasing after an old woman.

105
00:05:30,700 --> 00:05:31,940
Don't call her that!

106
00:05:32,099 --> 00:05:32,539
Mom,

107
00:05:32,779 --> 00:05:33,940
watch your words.

108
00:05:34,099 --> 00:05:35,419
My son takes a stranger's side.

109
00:05:35,740 --> 00:05:36,620
Why would I be nice?

110
00:05:36,820 --> 00:05:37,500
Do you like her?

111
00:05:37,779 --> 00:05:38,859
What are you talking about?

112
00:05:39,020 --> 00:05:40,180
Calm down!

113
00:05:41,060 --> 00:05:42,140
She's over 12 years older!

114
00:05:42,219 --> 00:05:43,380
Are you driving me crazy?

115
00:05:47,339 --> 00:05:47,859
Mom,

116
00:05:47,940 --> 00:05:49,260
don't be so mad.

117
00:05:51,219 --> 00:05:51,820
Please sit.

118
00:05:51,979 --> 00:05:52,580
Come on.

119
00:05:53,500 --> 00:05:54,580
Calm down.

120
00:05:57,260 --> 00:05:57,979
Mom,

121
00:05:58,219 --> 00:05:59,500
what are you, Cupid?

122
00:05:59,700 --> 00:06:00,260
Just because

123
00:06:00,500 --> 00:06:01,380
I get close

124
00:06:01,419 --> 00:06:02,140
to a woman,

125
00:06:02,419 --> 00:06:03,539
it means I like her?

126
00:06:06,659 --> 00:06:07,339
Fine.

127
00:06:09,539 --> 00:06:10,459
I admit I was

128
00:06:11,380 --> 00:06:12,620
a bit worked up just now.

129
00:06:13,940 --> 00:06:14,620
I apologize.

130
00:06:14,979 --> 00:06:15,459
But I really

131
00:06:15,500 --> 00:06:16,539
can't help worrying.

132
00:06:18,020 --> 00:06:19,419
So the best thing to do

133
00:06:21,940 --> 00:06:22,979
is stop seeing her.

134
00:06:23,740 --> 00:06:24,659
Why should I?

135
00:06:27,899 --> 00:06:28,899
Because I'm your mother.

136
00:06:29,820 --> 00:06:31,020
Because I care about you.

137
00:06:32,779 --> 00:06:34,299
You need to understand boundaries.

138
00:06:35,260 --> 00:06:36,700
Don't make things awkward for her.

139
00:06:37,339 --> 00:06:38,020
I don't agree.

140
00:06:38,979 --> 00:06:40,140
You're controlling my life.

141
00:06:42,020 --> 00:06:42,500
Fine.

142
00:06:44,700 --> 00:06:46,060
If you see her again,

143
00:06:47,339 --> 00:06:48,500
don't come back to see me.

144
00:06:49,659 --> 00:06:50,219
Wait,

145
00:06:50,459 --> 00:06:51,020
Mom.

146
00:06:51,500 --> 00:06:52,140
I don't know

147
00:06:52,140 --> 00:06:53,099
why you're so agitated!

148
00:06:53,099 --> 00:06:53,659
I already said

149
00:06:53,659 --> 00:06:54,380
there's nothing!

150
00:06:54,380 --> 00:06:55,419
We're just friends!

151
00:07:00,620 --> 00:07:01,659
I fear you'll go astray.

152
00:07:02,620 --> 00:07:04,020
You must listen to me on this.

153
00:07:13,721 --> 00:07:15,803
(Ren)

154
00:07:27,620 --> 00:07:28,580
What's wrong with Haoyu?

155
00:07:31,180 --> 00:07:32,339
He knows he was wrong.

156
00:07:33,260 --> 00:07:34,380
It's all sorted out.

157
00:07:36,099 --> 00:07:37,260
Don't get so worked up.

158
00:07:38,700 --> 00:07:39,740
Try the century egg congee

159
00:07:40,060 --> 00:07:41,779
he made for you.

160
00:07:42,099 --> 00:07:43,180
It's just a bit cold.

161
00:07:45,659 --> 00:07:46,299
Neither of you

162
00:07:46,299 --> 00:07:47,700
gives me peace of mind.

163
00:07:48,740 --> 00:07:49,539
How are things

164
00:07:49,620 --> 00:07:50,500
at the company?

165
00:07:52,979 --> 00:07:54,500
It's fine. Why?

166
00:07:56,180 --> 00:07:57,140
I doubt that.

167
00:07:57,620 --> 00:07:58,620
Didn't Yu Meng

168
00:07:59,140 --> 00:08:00,859
take away the signing authority?

169
00:08:01,539 --> 00:08:02,500
How did you know?

170
00:08:03,740 --> 00:08:04,940
You kept it from me,

171
00:08:05,979 --> 00:08:06,580
yet expected me

172
00:08:06,659 --> 00:08:08,299
to pay six million
to smooth things over.

173
00:08:12,500 --> 00:08:13,260
Don't worry.

174
00:08:14,859 --> 00:08:16,060
Even if she got it,

175
00:08:16,140 --> 00:08:16,899
what can she do?

176
00:08:17,580 --> 00:08:18,820
I used Chen Chen's matter

177
00:08:19,779 --> 00:08:21,099
to make Mr. Tian see her audit

178
00:08:21,620 --> 00:08:23,140
as nothing but jealousy

179
00:08:23,419 --> 00:08:24,180
and power abuse.

180
00:08:24,500 --> 00:08:25,979
Mr. Tian is displeased with her now.

181
00:08:26,419 --> 00:08:27,380
He'll address it openly

182
00:08:27,659 --> 00:08:28,779
at tomorrow's meeting.

183
00:08:29,020 --> 00:08:30,020
Her victory won't last.

184
00:08:30,899 --> 00:08:32,100
We'll be the winners.

185
00:08:32,299 --> 00:08:33,380
After saying all this,

186
00:08:34,699 --> 00:08:35,659
you just don't want

187
00:08:35,779 --> 00:08:36,579
to leave Jiali,

188
00:08:37,179 --> 00:08:37,779
right?

189
00:08:39,299 --> 00:08:40,020
Why?

190
00:08:41,819 --> 00:08:42,740
Because I want Jiali.

191
00:08:44,659 --> 00:08:45,740
Lately, there have been

192
00:08:46,100 --> 00:08:47,340
many rumors around the company.

193
00:08:47,980 --> 00:08:49,819
I even heard an employee

194
00:08:50,380 --> 00:08:52,179
posted under their real name
on the forum,

195
00:08:52,340 --> 00:08:53,260
claiming Jinghua

196
00:08:53,260 --> 00:08:54,699
has no issues at all,

197
00:08:54,740 --> 00:08:56,380
and the so-called audit

198
00:08:56,500 --> 00:08:58,140
is nothing but a ridiculous farce.

199
00:08:58,260 --> 00:08:59,740
The post is trending now.

200
00:08:59,939 --> 00:09:01,299
Everyone is deeply upset,

201
00:09:01,539 --> 00:09:02,620
slacking off in protest.

202
00:09:02,699 --> 00:09:03,779
That's just the poster's

203
00:09:03,779 --> 00:09:04,939
one-sided story.

204
00:09:05,419 --> 00:09:06,779
Speaking of one-sided,

205
00:09:07,059 --> 00:09:07,860
you're the only one

206
00:09:08,100 --> 00:09:09,220
who's been

207
00:09:09,220 --> 00:09:10,140
pushing this forward.

208
00:09:10,620 --> 00:09:11,659
Are you using this audit

209
00:09:11,740 --> 00:09:13,100
as an excuse

210
00:09:13,460 --> 00:09:15,140
to vent your personal feelings?

211
00:09:15,380 --> 00:09:15,939
Mr. Tian,

212
00:09:16,539 --> 00:09:17,980
my father asked for this audit.

213
00:09:18,299 --> 00:09:19,779
No personal feelings involved.

214
00:09:20,340 --> 00:09:21,179
I know Meng.

215
00:09:21,299 --> 00:09:22,179
She's never vague

216
00:09:22,419 --> 00:09:23,340
on important issues.

217
00:09:23,380 --> 00:09:24,500
Don't defend her

218
00:09:24,579 --> 00:09:25,579
just because

219
00:09:25,659 --> 00:09:26,779
she's your wife.

220
00:09:27,059 --> 00:09:27,779
The company

221
00:09:28,260 --> 00:09:29,260
follows protocol.

222
00:09:29,299 --> 00:09:30,620
Why are you so convinced

223
00:09:30,779 --> 00:09:31,659
that the audit

224
00:09:31,819 --> 00:09:32,899
is just me settling

225
00:09:33,020 --> 00:09:33,699
a personal score?

226
00:09:34,140 --> 00:09:35,340
I want to believe you,

227
00:09:35,779 --> 00:09:36,140
but

228
00:09:36,260 --> 00:09:37,899
knowing Yu,

229
00:09:38,220 --> 00:09:39,779
rushing an audit like this

230
00:09:39,899 --> 00:09:41,299
isn't his style.

231
00:09:41,419 --> 00:09:42,179
It has disrupted

232
00:09:42,260 --> 00:09:43,380
our company's projects.

233
00:09:43,620 --> 00:09:44,380
So I propose

234
00:09:44,899 --> 00:09:46,980
we vote to end the Jinghua audit,

235
00:09:47,299 --> 00:09:48,779
and get our operations back on track

236
00:09:48,779 --> 00:09:50,100
as soon as possible.

237
00:09:50,260 --> 00:09:51,299
Process payments

238
00:09:51,500 --> 00:09:52,340
immediately.

239
00:09:52,620 --> 00:09:53,659
Let's stop this nonsense.

240
00:09:53,819 --> 00:09:54,419
I agree.

241
00:09:54,579 --> 00:09:55,620
- Agreed.
- Agreed.

242
00:09:55,860 --> 00:09:56,419
No.

243
00:09:56,699 --> 00:09:57,768
We can stop the audit.

244
00:09:57,980 --> 00:09:59,380
What proof do you have

245
00:09:59,579 --> 00:10:01,020
that this audit

246
00:10:01,100 --> 00:10:02,140
wasn't my father's idea?

247
00:10:02,380 --> 00:10:03,779
And what proof do you have

248
00:10:04,059 --> 00:10:05,659
that it was his idea?

249
00:10:05,980 --> 00:10:07,140
- Exactly.
- How do you prove it?

250
00:10:07,260 --> 00:10:08,419
We know Yu very well.

251
00:10:08,579 --> 00:10:09,620
I am the proof.

252
00:10:13,620 --> 00:10:14,460
Here's the thing.

253
00:10:14,460 --> 00:10:16,020
Before Chairman Yu fell into a coma,

254
00:10:16,100 --> 00:10:17,299
he brought up Jinghua

255
00:10:17,419 --> 00:10:19,140
and mentioned an audit several times.

256
00:10:19,620 --> 00:10:21,299
As the company's CFO,

257
00:10:21,419 --> 00:10:22,779
and having worked under him

258
00:10:22,939 --> 00:10:24,419
for over 40 years,

259
00:10:24,980 --> 00:10:26,140
I can stand by

260
00:10:26,260 --> 00:10:26,939
what I said.

261
00:10:27,299 --> 00:10:28,340
So it seems

262
00:10:29,100 --> 00:10:30,500
I really did misunderstand Meng.

263
00:10:30,860 --> 00:10:31,939
I apologize, Meng.

264
00:10:34,020 --> 00:10:34,860
It's fine, Mr. Tian.

265
00:10:35,659 --> 00:10:37,020
You only did it for the company.

266
00:10:37,380 --> 00:10:38,140
Tian

267
00:10:38,460 --> 00:10:40,179
was just being professional.

268
00:10:40,539 --> 00:10:42,460
He was just worried the project

269
00:10:42,659 --> 00:10:44,260
would get delayed by the audit,

270
00:10:44,340 --> 00:10:46,340
hurting our daily operations.

271
00:10:46,539 --> 00:10:47,059
Yeah.

272
00:10:47,299 --> 00:10:48,899
How about this, everyone?

273
00:10:49,460 --> 00:10:50,539
Let's set a time limit

274
00:10:50,539 --> 00:10:51,500
on the audit.

275
00:10:52,020 --> 00:10:52,899
Within one week,

276
00:10:53,340 --> 00:10:54,579
we must have the results.

277
00:10:54,980 --> 00:10:55,460
I agree.

278
00:10:55,579 --> 00:10:56,179
Agreed.

279
00:10:56,419 --> 00:10:57,100
I agree.

280
00:10:58,380 --> 00:10:59,100
I also agree.

281
00:10:59,740 --> 00:11:00,980
Meng, what do you think?

282
00:11:01,419 --> 00:11:02,939
Meng and I both agree.

283
00:11:05,899 --> 00:11:07,899
With you backing Meng,

284
00:11:08,179 --> 00:11:09,260
that's wonderful.

285
00:11:10,939 --> 00:11:11,419
By the way,

286
00:11:11,939 --> 00:11:13,340
I have one more point.

287
00:11:13,620 --> 00:11:14,500
Given the damage

288
00:11:14,539 --> 00:11:15,179
this post

289
00:11:15,260 --> 00:11:16,500
has had internally,

290
00:11:16,779 --> 00:11:18,179
I think the poster should face

291
00:11:18,260 --> 00:11:19,400
serious consequences.

292
00:11:19,500 --> 00:11:20,500
What should we do?

293
00:11:20,819 --> 00:11:21,740
By company policy,

294
00:11:22,100 --> 00:11:22,620
fire them.

295
00:11:29,980 --> 00:11:30,939
Firing me only shows

296
00:11:30,980 --> 00:11:32,179
an admission of her guilt.

297
00:11:39,380 --> 00:11:40,020
Chen Chen,

298
00:11:41,980 --> 00:11:43,539
I saw your post.

