00:22:27,740 --> 00:22:28,619
Everyone was thrown

598
00:22:28,700 --> 00:22:29,460
into chaos,

599
00:22:29,460 --> 00:22:30,180
and in the end,

600
00:22:30,260 --> 00:22:31,260
nothing was found.

601
00:22:31,539 --> 00:22:32,500
In that case,

602
00:22:32,539 --> 00:22:33,260
shouldn't you also

603
00:22:33,379 --> 00:22:34,500
be held accountable, Ms. Yu?

604
00:22:35,059 --> 00:22:35,940
Meng did the audit

605
00:22:36,059 --> 00:22:37,099
following

606
00:22:37,220 --> 00:22:38,139
Chairman Yu's wishes.

607
00:22:38,420 --> 00:22:39,900
She only did it for the company.

608
00:22:40,180 --> 00:22:41,460
So she shouldn't bear

609
00:22:41,539 --> 00:22:42,420
any responsibility.

610
00:22:51,619 --> 00:22:53,460
Without definitive proof,

611
00:22:53,859 --> 00:22:54,779
we shouldn't suspect

612
00:22:54,819 --> 00:22:55,779
any of our own people.

613
00:22:56,139 --> 00:22:57,339
But to uncover the truth,

614
00:22:59,660 --> 00:23:01,539
Mr. Dong, you must follow protocol

615
00:23:02,299 --> 00:23:03,339
and be suspended.

616
00:23:04,819 --> 00:23:05,619
I object.

617
00:23:09,220 --> 00:23:10,379
It's about the launch date.

618
00:23:11,180 --> 00:23:11,859
At this time,

619
00:23:11,859 --> 00:23:12,980
if news leaks that our CFO

620
00:23:13,059 --> 00:23:13,779
is suspended

621
00:23:13,779 --> 00:23:14,700
under investigation,

622
00:23:15,260 --> 00:23:16,220
it won't reflect well

623
00:23:16,260 --> 00:23:17,500
on Jiali.

624
00:23:19,180 --> 00:23:20,260
I have a suggestion.

625
00:23:20,779 --> 00:23:21,660
Mr. Dong takes leave.

626
00:23:22,420 --> 00:23:23,339
That way, we protect

627
00:23:23,379 --> 00:23:24,220
Jiali's reputation,

628
00:23:24,619 --> 00:23:25,700
while also having him

629
00:23:26,220 --> 00:23:26,980
step down for now.

630
00:23:27,700 --> 00:23:29,299
(The theory of sacrificing pawns)

631
00:23:29,660 --> 00:23:31,940
(costs real blood in real life.)

632
00:23:32,460 --> 00:23:33,020
(I thought)

633
00:23:33,020 --> 00:23:34,220
(I was mentally prepared.)

634
00:23:34,579 --> 00:23:35,900
(Yet when I actually saw)

635
00:23:36,299 --> 00:23:37,539
(someone fall for me,)

636
00:23:37,980 --> 00:23:38,740
(I realized)

637
00:23:39,099 --> 00:23:40,579
(how much inevitable sacrifices)

638
00:23:40,779 --> 00:23:41,660
(truly hurt.)

639
00:23:41,819 --> 00:23:42,740
Didn't eat lunch?

640
00:23:42,900 --> 00:23:44,220
Have something sweet to recharge.

641
00:23:46,059 --> 00:23:46,740
No, thanks.

642
00:23:47,299 --> 00:23:48,180
I have no appetite.

643
00:23:48,579 --> 00:23:49,099
You go ahead.

644
00:23:49,460 --> 00:23:50,940
Still upset over Mr. Dong?

645
00:23:53,099 --> 00:23:54,139
Someone beat Liu Bai

646
00:23:54,139 --> 00:23:54,700
to reach him.

647
00:23:54,859 --> 00:23:55,819
That scoundrel Di Liren

648
00:23:55,859 --> 00:23:56,936
exploited a loophole.

649
00:23:57,420 --> 00:23:58,660
Even the best plans have flaws.

650
00:23:59,059 --> 00:24:00,460
He is hidden, but you are exposed.

651
00:24:00,740 --> 00:24:02,099
What happened today shows

652
00:24:02,139 --> 00:24:02,859
Di Liren has long

653
