661
00:24:18,099 --> 00:24:19,020
A nail that sticks out?

662
00:24:21,500 --> 00:24:23,059
The nail that sticks out gets hammered?

663
00:24:23,980 --> 00:24:25,139
Watch your mouth!

664
00:24:25,220 --> 00:24:26,020
You get hammered!

665
00:24:26,099 --> 00:24:26,980
- You get hammered!
- Ouch!

666
00:24:27,379 --> 00:24:28,460
You get hammered!

667
00:24:31,260 --> 00:24:32,059
Feeling better now?

668
00:24:34,539 --> 00:24:36,059
Who cheers someone up like that?

669
00:24:36,488 --> 00:24:37,928
No wonder you have no suitors.

670
00:24:39,339 --> 00:24:40,339
