678
00:24:58,379 --> 00:24:58,940
Go see him.

679
00:24:59,220 --> 00:24:59,819
It works.

680
00:25:01,180 --> 00:25:02,420
I'm afraid even a doctor

681
00:25:02,420 --> 00:25:04,420
