689
00:25:26,900 --> 00:25:27,740
Exactly.

690
00:25:29,220 --> 00:25:30,379
Wu Heng

691
00:25:30,460 --> 00:25:31,299
was a lost cause.

692
00:25:31,779 --> 00:25:32,579
We need to find

693
00:25:32,579 --> 00:25:33,139
another way.

694
00:25:33,619 --> 00:25:34,180
We should

695
00:25:34,180 --> 00:25:35,220
