699
00:25:38,619 --> 00:25:40,020
Once Di Liren is exposed,

700
00:25:40,420 --> 00:25:41,619
Mr. Dong will be safe.

701
00:25:41,900 --> 00:25:43,139
The pushback inside Jiali

702
00:25:43,139 --> 00:25:43,779
