703
00:25:44,220 --> 00:25:44,900
Without

704
00:25:44,940 --> 00:25:45,819
a solid reason,

705
00:25:45,859 --> 00:25:46,819
it's hard to have Jiali

706
00:25:46,859 --> 00:25:48,539
end cooperation
with Han Guang's factory.

707
00:25:48,779 --> 00:25:49,900
If we can't find evidence

708
00:25:49,940 --> 00:25:50,900
