875
00:31:38,980 --> 00:31:40,099
Stay tuned for our new drop,

876
00:31:40,299 --> 00:31:40,779
Jinghua.

877
00:31:41,020 --> 00:31:42,139
Stay tuned for our new drop,

878
00:31:42,339 --> 00:31:42,819
Jinghua.

879
00:31:43,500 --> 00:31:44,379
It turns out

880
00:31:44,420 --> 00:31:45,220
