could affect our marketing strategy.

892
00:32:02,299 --> 00:32:03,260
(We want fan perks!)

893
00:32:03,779 --> 00:32:05,539
(- Give us Jinghua!
- Come on, Mr. Di!)

894
00:32:05,539 --> 00:32:06,099
Honey,

895
00:32:06,779 --> 00:32:07,660
didn't you just agree

896
00:32:07,700 --> 00:32:09,059
to give perks to our fans?

897
00:32:09,420 --> 00:32:10,819
That's why I promised them.

898
00:32:11,579 --> 00:32:13,020
Now they've all heard it,

899
00:32:13,059 --> 00:32:14,660
and they all want Jinghua samples.

900
00:32:14,700 --> 00:32:15,779
Right, guys?

901
00:32:16,339 --> 00:32:18,059
Just make an exception, Honey.

902
00:32:18,139 --> 00:32:19,059
Just send them

903
00:32:19,099 --> 00:32:20,139
a few Jinghua samples.

904
00:32:20,299 --> 00:32:21,299
Don't embarrass me.

905
00:32:21,819 --> 00:32:22,900
Just give out some.

906
00:32:23,139 --> 00:32:24,020
Only a few, then.

907
00:32:24,579 --> 00:32:26,339
Hurry, everyone is watching.

908
00:32:29,740 --> 00:32:30,420
All right.

909
00:32:30,579 --> 00:32:31,400
We'll do that.

910
00:32:32,059 --> 00:32:32,579
However,

911
00:32:33,180 --> 00:32:33,980
only ten sets.

912
00:32:35,619 --> 00:32:37,099
My hands are tied too,

913
00:32:37,940 --> 00:32:39,020
so please understand.

914
00:32:40,420 --> 00:32:41,740
Let's all thank Mr. Di!

915
00:32:42,059 --> 00:32:43,460
Backstage, get ready

916
00:32:43,619 --> 00:32:44,940
to draw the lucky viewers!

917
00:32:49,420 --> 00:32:49,940
Don't worry.

918
00:32:50,139 --> 00:32:51,460
The draw is rigged for insiders.

919
00:32:52,819 --> 00:32:53,299
Honey,

920
00:32:53,660 --> 00:32:54,379
excuse me.

921
00:33:05,059 --> 00:33:05,339
You...

922
00:33:05,660 --> 00:33:06,504
Come with me.

923
00:33:10,859 --> 00:33:11,819
What are you doing here?

924
00:33:12,059 --> 00:33:12,579
When did you

925
00:33:12,579 --> 00:33:13,299
meet Yu Meng?

926
00:33:13,379 --> 00:33:13,900
And you?

927
00:33:14,579 --> 00:33:15,579
Did you cheat on Mom?

928
00:33:15,859 --> 00:33:17,020
Why pretend not to know me?

929
00:33:17,460 --> 00:33:18,220
And since when

930
00:33:19,260 --> 00:33:20,099
are you Di Liren?

931
00:33:20,500 --> 00:33:21,779
Calm down, will you?

932
00:33:22,779 --> 00:33:23,700
I'll explain everything

933
00:33:23,740 --> 00:33:24,579
you want to know

934
00:33:24,619 --> 00:33:25,260
once we're home.

935
00:33:25,299 --> 00:33:26,339
You don't even come home!

936
00:33:28,980 --> 00:33:29,579
Does Meng know

937
00:33:29,619 --> 00:33:30,539
you have a son?

938
00:33:32,099 --> 00:33:32,740
Not talking?

939
00:33:33,940 --> 00:33:35,208
In that case, I'll go tell her!

940
00:33:35,460 --> 00:33:35,819
Wait!

941
00:33:44,539 --> 00:33:45,660
Your mom and I are divorced.

942
00:33:47,700 --> 00:33:48,940
Yu Meng knows nothing.

943
00:33:49,379 --> 00:33:50,460
Stay away from them.

944
00:33:50,619 --> 00:33:51,819
Stop hanging around with them.

945
00:33:53,619 --> 00:33:54,579
I'll explain everything

946
00:33:54,940 --> 00:33:56,139
you want to know later,

947
00:33:56,180 --> 00:33:56,660
okay?

948
00:34:01,819 --> 00:34:02,299
Honey,

949
00:34:02,579 --> 00:34:03,700
I have things to do. Bye.

950
00:34:10,780 --> 00:34:12,219
Di Liren is holding back his anger.

951
00:34:12,300 --> 00:34:13,380
Stay at my place tonight.

952
00:34:13,900 --> 00:34:15,099
That's what I was thinking.

953
00:34:17,739 --> 00:34:19,059
Why did Harry suddenly

954
00:34:19,099 --> 00:34:20,059
show up in the stream?

955
00:34:20,500 --> 00:34:21,500
I have no idea.

956
00:34:23,940 --> 00:34:25,139
So it seems

957
00:34:25,780 --> 00:34:26,860
Harry really wasn't

958
00:34:26,900 --> 00:34:28,020
sent by Di Liren's side.

959
00:34:28,219 --> 00:34:29,900
Could it really just be a coincidence?

960
00:34:31,139 --> 00:34:32,059
Good heavens.

961
00:34:32,219 --> 00:34:33,380
Finally, you open your eyes.

962
00:34:34,619 --> 00:34:35,699
Oh, my.

963
00:34:36,420 --> 00:34:38,020
Now he's dragged into this too.

964
00:34:38,259 --> 00:34:39,460
As if it wasn't messy enough.

965
00:34:39,900 --> 00:34:41,460
You shouldn't worry tonight.

966
00:34:41,539 --> 00:34:42,659
Lu Hui and Di Liren should.

967
00:34:43,300 --> 00:34:44,179
The gears of fate

968
00:34:44,219 --> 00:34:45,259
have begun to turn.

969
00:34:45,739 --> 00:34:47,539
Who gets dragged in next

970
00:34:47,579 --> 00:34:48,340
is no longer

971
00:34:48,340 --> 00:34:49,059
under our control.

972
00:34:49,659 --> 00:34:50,300
You're right.

973
00:34:52,420 --> 00:34:53,780
If things don't go our way,

974
00:34:54,659 --> 00:34:55,980
we'll let nature take its course.

975
00:34:56,380 --> 00:34:56,780
Right.

976
00:34:57,020 --> 00:34:58,300
This has nothing to do with you.

977
00:34:58,500 --> 00:34:59,099
Let it go.

978
00:34:59,619 --> 00:35:00,020
Zi,

979
00:35:00,420 --> 00:35:01,579
how are the Jinghua samples?

980
00:35:02,059 --> 00:35:03,500
They're all with Liu Bai.

981
00:35:03,539 --> 00:35:05,288
Ready for testing tomorrow morning.

982
00:35:05,800 --> 00:35:06,820
Yes!

983
00:35:06,820 --> 00:35:07,380
Great.

984
00:35:24,699 --> 00:35:25,820
Why did you come back alone?

985
00:35:26,780 --> 00:35:27,619
Where's Haoyu?

986
00:35:29,139 --> 00:35:29,780
You know it?

987
00:35:30,099 --> 00:35:31,139
The second you saw him,

988
00:35:31,179 --> 00:35:32,139
you didn't call me.

989
00:35:32,780 --> 00:35:33,579
Now, you left him

990
00:35:33,619 --> 00:35:34,420
there all alone.

991
00:35:35,980 --> 00:35:36,780
Why don't you ask

992
00:35:36,820 --> 00:35:38,179
how he got into the stream today?

993
00:35:39,739 --> 00:35:40,860
Did you know all along?

994
00:35:41,139 --> 00:35:42,219
So what if I did?

995
00:35:42,659 --> 00:35:43,500
What could I say?

996
00:35:44,500 --> 00:35:45,739
All you care about right now

997
00:35:45,780 --> 00:35:46,659
is taking the company.

998
00:35:47,139 --> 00:35:48,099
Saying it won't help.

999
00:35:48,340 --> 00:35:49,579
If you had told me sooner,

1000
00:35:49,980 --> 00:35:50,500
it could've

1001
00:35:50,539 --> 00:35:51,420
been avoided.

1002
00:35:51,860 --> 00:35:52,619
Do you know

1003
00:35:52,619 --> 00:35:53,579
how helpless I was?

1004
00:35:55,500 --> 00:35:56,460
Now you know

1005
00:35:57,340 --> 00:35:57,860
how I felt

1006
00:35:57,900 --> 00:35:58,860
when I heard

1007
00:35:58,900 --> 00:35:59,940
you were staying at Jiali.

1008
00:36:01,300 --> 00:36:02,579
What you love is power,

1009
00:36:02,820 --> 00:36:03,699
calling the shots,

1010
00:36:04,020 --> 00:36:04,900
and being in control,

1011
00:36:05,579 --> 00:36:06,699
not Haoyu and me.

1012
00:36:07,300 --> 00:36:09,059
I gave so much to Jiali.

1013
00:36:09,619 --> 00:36:10,539
I need to see results.

1014
00:36:10,579 --> 00:36:11,500
So even if it

1015
00:36:11,539 --> 00:36:13,020
puts Haoyu and me in danger,

1016
00:36:13,699 --> 00:36:14,579
you don't care?

1017
00:36:14,780 --> 00:36:16,179
Of course, I wouldn't put you two

1018
00:36:16,219 --> 00:36:17,259
in any danger.

1019
00:36:18,300 --> 00:36:19,300
I hope you mean that.

1020
00:36:20,659 --> 00:36:21,940
What did you say to Haoyu?

1021
00:36:25,259 --> 00:36:25,860
I

1022
00:36:26,739 --> 00:36:28,059
admitted that we're divorced.

1023
00:36:29,820 --> 00:36:30,980
Under those circumstances,

1024
00:36:31,380 --> 00:36:32,940
coming clean was the best choice.

1025
00:36:35,059 --> 00:36:35,460
Hui.

1026
00:36:35,739 --> 00:36:36,020
Hui.

1027
00:36:36,020 --> 00:36:36,780
Don't follow me!

1028
00:36:37,820 --> 00:36:38,900
Calm down first.

1029
00:36:39,259 --> 00:36:40,219
We need to work together

1030
00:36:40,820 --> 00:36:42,420
to keep up the act in front of Haoyu.

1031
00:36:44,900 --> 00:36:45,579
Listen to me,

1032
00:36:45,940 --> 00:36:46,380
okay?

1033
00:36:49,259 --> 00:36:49,980
Haoyu,

1034
00:36:51,820 --> 00:36:52,739
I shouldn't have kept

1035
00:36:53,780 --> 00:36:54,780
the divorce from you.

1036
00:36:58,500 --> 00:36:59,739
Did you enjoy lying to me?

1037
00:37:00,659 --> 00:37:01,900
You said he was on business.

1038
00:37:02,460 --> 00:37:03,099
What a lie.

1039
00:37:04,500 --> 00:37:04,940
There are

1040
00:37:04,980 --> 00:37:06,139
barely any of Dad's things,

1041
00:37:07,780 --> 00:37:08,860
so he moved out long ago,

1042
00:37:08,900 --> 00:37:09,259
right?

1043
00:37:17,539 --> 00:37:18,380
What you said before

1044
00:37:19,059 --> 00:37:20,500
about our family being reunited

1045
00:37:20,980 --> 00:37:21,699
was just an act.

1046
00:37:22,420 --> 00:37:23,579
But we love you.

1047
00:37:23,980 --> 00:37:24,619
Haoyu,

1048
00:37:25,179 --> 00:37:26,259
this is for your own good.

1049
00:37:28,460 --> 00:37:29,619
Can you just be honest?

1050
00:37:30,020 --> 00:37:31,139
When did you get divorced?

1051
00:37:31,619 --> 00:37:32,820
Before you went to the UK.

1052
00:37:33,539 --> 00:37:34,380
Why not tell me?

1053
00:37:38,300 --> 00:37:39,780
You were alone in a foreign country,

1054
00:37:40,300 --> 00:37:41,300
a stranger there.

1055
00:37:42,380 --> 00:37:44,300
We didn't want to burden you.

1056
00:37:45,699 --> 00:37:46,380
Haoyu,

1057
00:37:48,139 --> 00:37:49,420
it was an amicable split.

1058
00:37:49,780 --> 00:37:50,980
Even if we're not together,

1059
00:37:51,619 --> 00:37:52,940
we're still your parents,

1060
00:37:53,259 --> 00:37:54,300
and we still love you.

1061
00:37:55,659 --> 00:37:56,780
Could you please

1062
00:37:58,219 --> 00:37:59,460
try to understand us?

1063
00:38:00,420 --> 00:38:00,780
So...

1064
00:38:02,659 --> 00:38:03,340
What about Meng?

1065
00:38:04,099 --> 00:38:05,179
You dare bring her up?

1066
00:38:13,303 --> 00:38:16,424
(Han Guang)

1067
00:38:24,344 --> 00:38:27,252
(Han Guang)

1068
00:38:35,460 --> 00:38:36,539
Why did Yu Meng

1069
00:38:36,619 --> 00:38:37,619
suddenly send samples

1070
00:38:37,659 --> 00:38:38,420
in the livestream?

1071
00:38:38,900 --> 00:38:40,380
You know the samples have issues.

1072
00:38:41,780 --> 00:38:42,699
It was an ambush.

1073
00:38:44,259 --> 00:38:45,340
Don't worry about it.

1074
00:38:45,460 --> 00:38:46,380
Let her mess around.

1075
00:38:46,940 --> 00:38:48,539
Everything is under control.

1076
00:38:49,780 --> 00:38:50,659
Trust me.

1077
00:38:51,219 --> 00:38:53,139
I can handle whatever she throws at us.

1078
00:38:53,780 --> 00:38:55,739
Don't get so worked up.

1079
00:38:56,619 --> 00:38:57,340
Wait. But...

1080
00:38:57,820 --> 00:38:59,539
Yu Meng keeps blindsiding us.

1081
00:38:59,900 --> 00:39:01,619
Stop acting so relaxed.

1082
00:39:02,259 --> 00:39:04,020
Do you think I won't hit back?

1083
00:39:04,659 --> 00:39:05,420
What's your plan?

1084
00:39:05,460 --> 00:39:06,099
Let me hear it.

1085
00:39:17,179 --> 00:39:18,020
Starting tomorrow,

1086
00:39:18,739 --> 00:39:19,900
join the finance department.

1087
00:39:20,820 --> 00:39:21,860
Do what you need to do.

1088
00:39:25,900 --> 00:39:26,900
Dong Jun is gone.

1089
00:39:27,300 --> 00:39:28,820
Time to make room for someone new.

1090
00:39:31,579 --> 00:39:33,340
You not only counter every move,

1091
00:39:33,860 --> 00:39:35,099
you even plan ahead.

1092
00:39:43,752 --> 00:39:46,578
=The Vanishing Beauty=
(Next Episode Preview)

1093
00:39:46,894 --> 00:39:47,139
(Lucky Beauty Yu)

1094
00:39:47,139 --> 00:39:47,940
(Lu Hui)
Wait, that's not right.

1095
00:39:48,820 --> 00:39:49,699
Dad was dating Meng

1096
00:39:49,860 --> 00:39:51,179
before the divorce.

1097
00:39:52,219 --> 00:39:53,179
How about joining Jiali

1098
00:39:53,460 --> 00:39:54,460
and being my assistant?

1099
00:39:55,539 --> 00:39:56,179
Who are you?

1100
00:39:57,219 --> 00:39:58,219
We don't know each other.

1101
00:39:58,579 --> 00:39:59,860
But you should know me.

1102
00:40:00,860 --> 00:40:02,539
Every time you wired money to Di Liren,

1103
00:40:03,420 --> 00:40:05,179
that account ending in 304

1104
00:40:05,539 --> 00:40:06,300
was mine.

1105
00:40:08,259 --> 00:40:09,059
Police.

1106
00:40:09,699 --> 00:40:11,020
Three days in criminal detention.

1107
00:40:11,020 --> 00:40:12,179
Di Liren has pressed charges.

1108
00:40:12,780 --> 00:40:13,980
That fool!

1109
00:40:14,500 --> 00:40:16,099
I'm not just making the whole company

1110
00:40:16,179 --> 00:40:17,980
think she's crazy.

1111
00:40:18,579 --> 00:40:19,619
I want her to end up

1112
00:40:19,739 --> 00:40:21,179
with no one but me.

1113
00:40:36,516 --> 00:40:41,385
♪Old dreams have faded in color♪

1114
00:40:43,869 --> 00:40:48,732
♪A lonely heart torn in conflict♪

1115
00:40:51,190 --> 00:40:56,035
♪The love that stumbled along♪

1116
00:40:56,480 --> 00:41:02,982
♪Was just a quiet release♪

1117
00:41:05,714 --> 00:41:12,667
♪I write the future into a song,
honoring the brave with no regrets♪

1118
00:41:13,217 --> 00:41:19,147
♪Turning all losses
into the passion of this moment♪

1119
00:41:20,271 --> 00:41:27,502
♪I write the future into a song,
for the me who never walks away♪

1120
00:41:27,805 --> 00:41:32,978
♪Forging all weaknesses
into sharp, bold colors♪

1121
00:41:33,598 --> 00:41:45,066
♪In this life,
I follow only my own choice♪

1122
00:41:47,566 --> 00:41:52,814
♪The chilled night has lost its color♪

1123
00:41:54,855 --> 00:42:00,290
♪No need to echo those
who drifted apart♪

1124
00:42:02,112 --> 00:42:07,509
♪No longer proving my worth to anyone♪

1125
00:42:07,509 --> 00:42:16,154
♪The answer has long been etched
in my silhouette♪

1126
00:42:16,630 --> 00:42:24,193
♪I write the future into a song,
for the me who never walks away♪

1127
00:42:24,193 --> 00:42:30,039
♪Paving every twist and turn
into a path forward♪

1128
00:42:30,039 --> 00:42:40,206
♪The ending of this life
will be set by me♪

